WEBVTT

0
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Zine! Zine! Zine! — Ideas in Motion

1
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Ideas in Motion is an exhibition supervised by Xiao Jian.

2
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Students on the History of Communication Thought course

3
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.000
present works on themes including

4
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.000
individual memories,

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.000
our most intimate media,

6
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.000
the communication ideas we most want to follow or challenge,

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.000
and the future media forms we most want to realise.

8
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Together, they offer a feast of ideas.

9
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Liu Songting, course student: It mainly has two parts.

10
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.000
One is a physical metaphor of myself.

11
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.000
The other consists of

12
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.000
some works derived from it.

13
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.000
That media montage

14
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.000
is my later expression of

15
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.000
some of my attitudes towards life.

16
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Zhao Xinran, course student: Before the exhibition,

17
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Xiao Jian said she wanted

18
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.000
to buy some toilets to use as seats.

19
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.000
That may have inspired me

20
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.000
to make something related to toilets.

21
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.000
Another aspect is that

22
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.000
I have told friends

23
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.000
that I now find it difficult to read

24
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.000
long texts… to do long-form reading.

25
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.000
My reading time now consists of

26
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.000
very fragmented activities.

27
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.000
So I wanted to respond to this…

28
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.000
Huang Ruizhe, course student: I feel a pocket is like

29
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.000
a fixed accessory to a piece of clothing.

30
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.000
If you pull hard, it comes off.

31
00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.000
The theme of our exhibition is

32
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Ideas in Motion.

33
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.000
I wanted this fixed pocket

34
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.000
to move as well.

35
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.000
So I wanted the pocket

36
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.000
to carry individual, independent stories,

37
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.000
and to use ribbons

38
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.000
to connect these stories.

39
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.000
That is where my work came from.

40
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:51.560
An on-site report by the Zhejiang University Integrated Media Centre student reporters.

